"with our secure password reset form. Enter your email address and follow the "
"steps to get back into your account and access your paper summaries. Get "
"fast, accurate, and easy-to-read paper summaries."
msgstr ""
"Réinitialisez votre mot de passe pour notre service de résumé de papiers "
